  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "No sign-in: the role switcher picks the viewer; the server masks state per role",
        "Secrets only in Vercel: Anthropic key, CRON_SECRET, encryption key, Blob token",
        "Server functions ship no client data; CI has no secrets and calls no model",
        "Identifiers are masked before text goes to the Anthropic API"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Read-only inputs, by pointer",
      "items": [
        "Packet and AI payload are AES-256-GCM sealed; production holds only RETURN_ID",
        "The packet must hash to RETURN_ID or the app fails closed",
        "The laptop reader (ai/reader.ts) makes only the eval payload CI scores"
      ]
    }
  ]
